# What gcloud builds submit sends to Cloud Build. Without this file gcloud uses the .gitignore, which ignores .skills, and
# the image would be built with no catalog. The exclusions are the ones of .dockerignore, anchored to the root with a
# leading slash because the syntax here is the one of .gitignore, where a bare name matches at any depth. .skills goes
# up with its own .git, because the catalog generator reads the history there.
/.git
/node_modules
/dist
/.env
/.env.*
/.tanstack
/*.tsbuildinfo
/test-results
/e2e-results.xml
*.test.ts
/e2e
/playwright.config.ts
/skills.env
